    "created_at": "2021-01-23T08:51:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-01-23T08:51:24Z",
    "body": "Hello @ljohnston,\r\n\r\nthe feature didn't go away. It is still working. Did you include `($count)` in your `starship.toml` for the respective `git_status` variables (see: [configuration/#git-status](https://starship.rs/config/#git-status))?\r\n\r\nYou can try to add this to your `starship.toml`:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[git_status]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nformat = '([\\[$all_status$ahead_behind\\]]($style) )'\r\nstyle = \"red bold\"\r\nstashed = '\\$${count}'\r\nahead = \"⇡${count}\"\r\nbehind = \"⇣${count}\"\r\ndiverged = \"⇕${count}\"\r\nconflicted = \"=${count}\"\r\ndeleted = \"✘${count}\"\r\nrenamed = \"»${count}\"\r\nmodified = \"!${count}\"\r\nstaged = \"+${count}\"\r\nuntracked = \"?${count}\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nDoes your problem still persist after the above changes to your `starship.toml`?\r\n\r\nTake care\r\nMick",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
